    analogyTitle: 'Smart GPS Lookup vs Old Fragile Street-Count Directions',
    analogyEn: 'Old `VLOOKUP` broke whenever someone inserted a column (column 4 became 5!); `XLOOKUP` points directly to the Return Column so it NEVER breaks!',
    analogyHi: 'Purana `VLOOKUP` ek column insert hote hi toot jata tha; `XLOOKUP` seedha return column ko point karta hai isliye kabhi break nahi hota!',
